 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Merged old k2 High-top sneaker into Basketball sneaker and k1 Low-top sneaker into Court sneaker; cut is now type t (High/Mid/Low). Dropped as retail SKU noise: adidas VL Court 3.0, Reebok Court Advance, Lacoste Straightset 2.0. Old 'Chuck 70' (low) folded into Chuck Taylor All Star versions. Left for other shelves: adidas Ozweego (Chunky sneaker), Puma Palermo (Terrace sneaker). Run Star and Star Player 76 kept in m (no archetype page retrieved). Lacoste Carnaby kept in m; Puma Smash not added (no page retrieved; Parallel and Firecrawl out of credit, Wikidata rate-limited). Vans Old Skool (#36, c. 1976) left to the Skate shoe shelf. AJ III/IV/XI kept as versions of Air Jordan 1 (the line)."
}